    <question_explanation no="20" id="PRB-97660E5EF0DE849B-Q20">
      <question_stem>다음 카르노 맵(Karnaugh map)과 일치하는 논리식은?</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="긍정형(옳은/적절한 것 고르기)" category="핵심 개념·이론 이해형" />
      <topic_keywords>
        <keyword>다음 카르노 맵(Karnaugh map)</keyword>
      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>4</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>$wz + {\bar{x}} z + {\bar{z}} y$</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 전자공학개론 · 카르노 맵의 간략화
정답은 ④이다. 행(xy)과 열(wz)로 읽으면 wz = 11 열은 모두 1이므로 wz, xy = 00·01 행의 wz = 01·11 칸은 x̄z, xy = 01·11 행의 wz = 00·10 칸은 z̄y로 묶인다. 따라서 F = wz + x̄z + z̄y이다.</overall_commentary>
      <passage_evidence>| $wz$  $xy$ | 00 | 01 | 11 | 10 |</passage_evidence>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>$w {\bar{z}} + {\bar{x}} z + zy$</choice_text>
          <commentary>일치하지 않는다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>${\bar{w}} z + x {\bar{z}} + z {\bar{y}}$</choice_text>
          <commentary>일치하지 않는다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>$wz + x {\bar{z}} + {\bar{z}} \bar{y}$</choice_text>
          <commentary>일치하지 않는다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>$wz + {\bar{x}} z + {\bar{z}} y$</choice_text>
          <commentary>정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
